      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t understand well why you must keep the transport type as the key on T-. This is purely internal to connectivity service, isn\u0027t it ? Can\u0027t we use a single data structure and only separate the outputs ? From the network you can get the transport types if you want, so if netd T- requires the label to be the transport type you\u0027ll be able to do that.",
